@ersss/dsh-migrate README · What gets written：DSH's session log is an append-only JSONL event stream (`SESSION_FORMAT_VERSION 0`). For every source session, `dsh-migrate` writes one log:

```
$DSH_HOME/sessions-imported/--<project>--/<id>/session.jsonl

{"type":"session","version":0,"id":"…","createdAt":…,"delegationDepth":0,"cwd":"…"}
  {"type":"turn/start","seq":0,"time":…,"data":{"turn":1}}

